# Raw capture footage is large (a single beat-2 take is ~250 MB of 1080p30).
# The deliverables that belong in git are tools/video/manifest.json (the measured
# timeline) and the small evidence files below, not the video itself.
raw/*.mp4
raw/*.webm
raw/*.mkv
demo-silent.mp4
demo-*.mp4

# Keep the evidence the manifest's numbers are derived from.
!raw/explain-result.json
!raw/permalink.txt
!raw/webhook.log

# Intro + final cut: all regenerable from tools/video/. The deliverables that belong
# in git are the card HTML, tools/video/intro/intro-manifest.json, NARRATION-SCRIPT.md
# and CAPTIONS.srt — not the rendered frames or the encodes.
intro/intro.mp4
intro/cards/*.png
intro/segments/
whodunit-final.mp4
cut*.mp4
.work/
